{
    "word": "whereupon",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e29d1d38-4a4c-32f5-9fdd-1f743b44e2b6",
                "word": "whereupon",
                "pos": "conj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cac0cf05-ec1e-3509-b851-25aa4e3a6ad8",
                        "entry_id": "e29d1d38-4a4c-32f5-9fdd-1f743b44e2b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "After which, in consequence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "59e40a53-9636-49a8-86fd-30c4c11ad6bc",
                                "sense_id": "cac0cf05-ec1e-3509-b851-25aa4e3a6ad8",
                                "text": "The network went down, whereupon I made a cup of tea"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9df0da2-cdc1-4d79-b74a-24120014aae7",
                                "sense_id": "cac0cf05-ec1e-3509-b851-25aa4e3a6ad8",
                                "text": "This was followed by his presenting his sable acquaintance with a fig of tobacco, whereupon, instead of thanking the donor in the usual way, the black signified his gratitude by throwing a spear at twenty or thirty yards' distance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                        "entry_id": "e29d1d38-4a4c-32f5-9fdd-1f743b44e2b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Upon which."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fce31034-26d8-403d-9171-6cd9750e39d7",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "the wet cliff whereupon he stood"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee8ea7a6-cdd3-4745-8835-ffb68f7aa504",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "My tender wife and children standing by, / Dewing the death-bed whereupon I lie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "500a9a82-b5aa-4e63-a416-f7c80dfe2ef8",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "You see that the Apostle speaks as one who had distinct and certain knowledge of the grounds whereupon he was standing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f1e8b05-324e-49d0-99e8-78935ecc1667",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "Gradually, however, the white clouds resolved themselves into the snowy linen and coverlets of a bed whereupon he was lying, whilst the crimson light proved to be the effect of a blazing fire, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8cb1b1a-90e3-4719-8c37-f18cb5f09971",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "He sprung from his bed, whereupon one of them had fired. He pursued them as they retreated, and they fled out of the house by the back door. Thereupon he returned to the bed, saw that his wife had been shot, and roused the servants […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef24fc81-6307-4971-b997-8b6d7daf731e",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "[…]could take no rest except such as he obtained by supporting himself on his knees and elbows, being unable to suffer any part of his body to touch the bed whereupon he lay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3da2d83-08e9-4fd9-9eb5-67835336c9e2",
                                "sense_id": "410f8a91-247e-3e57-88fe-8d49c12163ac",
                                "text": "The Democrats sent a very political and long response memo which they knew, because of sources and methods (and more), would have to be heavily redacted, whereupon they would blame the White House for lack of transparency. Told them to re-do and send back in proper form!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "074a78ad-eb5c-4a45-9bb3-b7074ca3f2ad",
                        "source_entry_id": "e29d1d38-4a4c-32f5-9fdd-1f743b44e2b6",
                        "source_sense_description": "after which",
                        "target_lang_word": "waarop",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "waarop",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9be4436d-339b-3e0e-9805-5bb3b020fa77",
                                        "entry_id": "329012f2-2e4d-3b6c-8e5b-dd333217ba28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vragend op wat?, op welk?"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2e5abad-41f7-4cc5-adc4-a08e3c17832a",
                                                "sense_id": "9be4436d-339b-3e0e-9805-5bb3b020fa77",
                                                "text": "waarop staat die vaas met bloemen?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c16fc27e-05b9-419d-a0a8-abd0a5465127",
                                                "sense_id": "9be4436d-339b-3e0e-9805-5bb3b020fa77",
                                                "text": "waarop slaat dat nu?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c41fddb-1484-3968-ad40-642464a734a2",
                                        "entry_id": "329012f2-2e4d-3b6c-8e5b-dd333217ba28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "betrekkelijk op wat, op hetwelk"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3180e0a2-a2ef-462c-8b56-ac710a681377",
                                                "sense_id": "0c41fddb-1484-3968-ad40-642464a734a2",
                                                "text": "Dit is de tafel waarop de vaas staat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab7aceef-c32d-4196-bd33-3605925cc37c",
                                                "sense_id": "0c41fddb-1484-3968-ad40-642464a734a2",
                                                "text": "Het viel mij best tegen toen ik een bord zag waarop mile 1 stond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e35f0cbc-416d-40f7-9b00-8857b0defaca",
                                                "sense_id": "0c41fddb-1484-3968-ad40-642464a734a2",
                                                "text": "De rest is geschiedenis, gedetailleerd te zien op de expositie in Assen. Achter het podium met de oude gitaren hangt het scherm waarop de films te zien zijn van de Amerikaanse bluesreizen die Muskee maakte met Albert Haar. Daar zijn ook de beelden te zien van het karige Tutwiler, Mississippi, waar ze op zoek gingen naar het graf van Sonny Boy Williamson II."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64f63278-2830-465c-8322-e1c7119607e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "e29d1d38-4a4c-32f5-9fdd-1f743b44e2b6",
                        "source_sense_description": "after which",
                        "target_lang_word": "après quoi",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "après quoi",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e02862c9-8c3d-3a7b-8f80-9aaee541fe71",
                                        "entry_id": "6e1ea09b-de09-38c3-851c-50e0625b253c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Et venant ensuite, comme conséquence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "553b5513-ddc5-45b1-b28b-2412ae7d7378",
                                                "sense_id": "e02862c9-8c3d-3a7b-8f80-9aaee541fe71",
                                                "text": "Je demeurai avec eux jusqu’à ce qu’ils eussent amassé la quantité de poivre qu'ils voulurent; après quoi ils me firent embarquer sur le bâtiment qui les avait amenés, et nous nous rendîmes dans une autre île d'où ils étaient venus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e49f872-4140-4d01-933d-d082760b51e0",
                                                "sense_id": "e02862c9-8c3d-3a7b-8f80-9aaee541fe71",
                                                "text": "Parpoil et Gaspard demeurèrent immobiles pendant une seconde, après quoi Gaspard tourna les talons et regrimpa l’escalier quatre à quatre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3d21acc-877b-48e3-988f-8a7c4c9c8e8b",
                                                "sense_id": "e02862c9-8c3d-3a7b-8f80-9aaee541fe71",
                                                "text": "Monsieur Saito me présenta brièvement à l'assemblée. Après quoi il me demanda si j'aimais les défis"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e8193ef-92d3-42ac-aa46-c814f2b37f32",
                                                "sense_id": "e02862c9-8c3d-3a7b-8f80-9aaee541fe71",
                                                "text": "Je commençai par envoyer mon verre de whisky dans la figure du premier lieutenant, une claque du revers de la main dans la figure du second, après quoi, je m'assis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
